{title: Jingle Bells}
{subtitle: James Lord Pierpont (1857) - public domain}
{key: G}
# Testo e accordi: https://github.com/cardinote/christmas-chords-lyrics (src/Jingle-Bells.txt, licenza MIT)
# Confrontato con: https://de.wikibooks.org/wiki/Liederbuch/_Jingle_Bells
